I. Hardware Requirments

   1. IBM-PC at	or higher, or 100% compatible machines,	with at	least 640k of
      base memory. ( another 32k or more EMS memory is required	for the
      animated background option VGA display. )
   2. VGA display.
   3. At least one 1.2 mb floppy disk drive and	one hard disk.
   4. Keyboard and support for mouse and joystick.
   5. Support for Adlib, Sound Blaster Card, Mt-32, General Midi.

II. System Configuration

   1. Dos 3.3 or Later.
   2. Sound card ( optional ).
   3. 554k of free Main	Memory.
   4. To see the animated background least 32k of Extended Memory.
   5. Use arrow	keys to	highlight the selected item and	then press enter to
      change the settings.

III. How to play

   1. If you need to change sound settings, run	Install	program	and use	arrow
      keys to change it. Notice, do not	select on "Install Game	to Hard	Disk"
      column. It is not	for Shareware Version.
   2. Run this Game by executing sango.exe file.
   3. After Brief demo You wiil	see the	main menu, then	use arrow key to choose
      INSTRUCTIONS. You	will be	an excellent player after briefing through the
      rules and	instructions.

IV. Reigstered features

  1. Full stroy	mode can role any chinese history heros	to defeat CAO CAO to
     restore the Eastern-Han Dynasty.
  2. Chinese characters	extend to tweleve, over	50 combat skills not only a
